# LLM_Judge_Precision_Recall.xlsx is my working file to evaluate the LLM-as-a-judge to determine the precision and recall.
# bm25_baseline_results (CSV & JSON) is generated from NonAI_Baseline_BM25.py and contain the evaluation result for each case using BM25.
# category_pass_rates.csv is generated from NonAI_Baseline_BM25.py and contain a table showing the evaluation result for each category using BM25.
# eval_50_cases (CSV & JSON) is generated from CreateCaseJSON.py and contain the 50 evaluation cases (Questions, Answer, Procedure Reference, Supporting Sentence, Category).
# eval_detailed_results (CSV & JSON) is generated from RunRag.py and contain the evaluation results for each case using RAG with LLM-as-a-Judge. 
# rag_evaluation_table is the table saved from python after running RunRag.py.
